Z||000000||maryjane||07-27-2001||09:35 PM||||Woman in a bar sits down beside beside a guy with a cowboy hat on.asks" are you a real cowboy?" he replies" I guess, I've ridden horses & worked on a ranch since I was 12. Spend my days lookin after cattle, roundin up strays,brandin calves and fixin fences. It's about all I do,spend a lot of time alone & thinkin tho." Woman says" I'm a lesbian. I love women, love lookin at em, thinkin about them. I think about what they wear, what they smell like, what they sound like, what they do, where they go and everything else. well, nice talking to you, I gotta go." A little later, another woman sits down, asks " are you a cowboy?" Man replies. "Well, always thought I was, just found out I'm a lesbian!<P>(note) If this jk is too risque for this forum, post, I will delete it.<BR>||||reg||1
